<title>NETHERLANDS: Dutch cocoa grind up 10.4 pct yr/yr in Q2.</title>
<headline>Dutch cocoa grind up 10.4 pct yr/yr in Q2.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1997-07-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Dutch cocoa grind rose 10.4 percent to 100,132 tonnes in the second quarter of this year, from 90,724 tonnes in the same period of 1996, the Dutch Cocoa Association (NCV) said on Friday.</p>
<p>Analysts had expected the grind to show a modest rise.</p>
<p>In the first quarter of the year, the grind was up 1.46 percent to 102,338 tonnes.</p>
<p>--Amsterdam Newsroom +31 20 504 5000</p>
